sequenceDiagram
  participant T as TPP
  participant W as WAF / API Gateway
  participant C as Consent Service
  participant B as Open Banking BFF
  participant S as Account / Transfer Service
  T->>W: AIS or PIS request
  W->>C: Validate TPP, consent, SCA and scope
  C-->>W: Short-lived verified ConsentContext
  W->>B: Request + verified context
  B->>S: Reused managed business contract
  S-->>B: Account or transfer result
  B-->>T: Versioned REST response

